  "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/build-interactive-mcp-apps-using-amazon-bedrock-agentcore/",
  "sourceTitle": "Build interactive MCP Apps using Amazon Bedrock AgentCore",
  "sourceBodyHash": "03d4a1da88a4a68892cb959e4837d3444bb426d9a9b7db87b017052ff2736bcd",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "partial",
  "importanceLevel": 5,
  "provider": "openrouter",
  "requestedModel": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free",
  "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free",
  "createdAt": "2026-09-11T23:11:48.308247Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-03T20:55:41.417840Z",
  "totalBlocks": 86,
  "translatedBlocks": 52,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "34e1bdff05f94389",
      "translationZh": "随着客户转向通过 ChatGPT 和 Claude 等 AI 主机与数字服务交互，组织需要一种方法，使其服务在这些应用程序中具有丰富的用户界面（UI）而不仅仅是纯文本。他们还需要在不依赖单一主机的情况下实现这一点。MCP Apps 和 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 正好提供了这一点。MCP Apps 通过直接在 AI 主机内部渲染的交互式 HTML 小部件扩展了模型上下文协议（MCP）。Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 是一个平台，用于使用任何框架或模型大规模构建、连接和优化代理。具体针对 MCP Apps，AgentCore 运行时（Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 的一个功能）提供了一个安全、无服务器、会话隔离的主机，并具有原生 MCP 支持。AgentCore 网关（Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 的一个功能）通过一个 MCP Apps 兼容主机可以访问的单一安全端点公开它。AgentCore 处理这种非差异化繁重的工作，因此您可以专注于业务逻辑和小部件设计。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "baea8b85b87d4897",
      "translationZh": "在本文中，我们演示如何在 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 上构建和部署具有交互式 HTML 小部件的 MCP App。由于 MCP Apps 是一种与主机无关的标准，该应用程序在支持 Apps 扩展的 AI 主机上提供相同的丰富体验。使用示例应用程序 Unicorn Rentals，客户可以浏览可用的独角兽、预订租赁、查看活跃预订并归还独角兽。无论客户在 ChatGPT、Claude 或其他支持的主机上打开 Unicorn Rentals，它看起来和感觉都是一样的。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7e9afc3b23e89bdf",
      "translationZh": "在进入架构之前，让我们看看应用程序的实际运行情况。Unicorn Rentals 被部署为 MCP App 并连接到 AI 主机。以下示例使用 ChatGPT，但同一服务器在 Claude 或其他支持 MCP Apps 扩展的主机上也能工作。我们将通过四个步骤进行演练，从浏览车队到归还独角兽。让我们开始吧。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "809bb5203e96bc28",
      "translationZh": "步骤 1：列出可用的独角兽",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "12e4df79f30dfcf8",
      "translationZh": "我们从自然语言问题开始：“你能显示所有独角兽吗？”主机解释了这个问题，并为每只独角兽渲染一张交互式卡片，显示其图像、名称、描述、每小时费率和可用性，而不是纯文本列表。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e98f4bea62203c4a",
      "translationZh": "图 1：AI 主机将可用的独角兽渲染为交互式卡片。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "480fe27366462083",
      "translationZh": "步骤 2：预订独角兽",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d3b6954c1eba8286",
      "translationZh": "如果你最喜欢的独角兽是 Stardust，你可以通过说“我想预订 Stardust 独角兽”来租用它。应用程序记录了预订并立即确认，显示预订 ID、日期、每小时费率和你预订的独角兽。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d474d6d95fa7460c",
      "translationZh": "图 2：预订已确认，详情显示在聊天中。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "11f896a2bafdd8c5",
      "translationZh": "步骤 3：查看您的预订",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1806ace2414c3e5c",
      "translationZh": "要检查您当前租用的物品，您可以说“Show me my unicorn bookings”。应用程序返回您的活跃租赁，以及已发生的时长和费用。这次响应以文本形式返回而不是卡片，因为并非每个请求都需要丰富的界面。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "227849104d22cd0b",
      "translationZh": "图 3：活跃租赁以文本形式返回而不是卡片。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e3492991121187e6",
      "translationZh": "步骤 4：归还独角兽",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5c89c83c1442f165",
      "translationZh": "最后，“I would like to return my unicorn” 结束了租赁。应用程序根据时长和时薪计算总费用，并在对话中报告。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "63247511f25e1172",
      "translationZh": "图 4：租赁结束，总费用被报告。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "88f48481991f98ab",
      "translationZh": "您刚才看到的一切都由运行在 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 运行时上的单个 MCP 服务器提供服务，前面有一个 AgentCore 网关。本文的其余部分展示了它是如何构建的以及如何自行部署。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "76a95b368e427987",
      "translationZh": "该解决方案在 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 上部署了一个 MCP 应用，通过模型上下文协议（Model Context Protocol）公开业务逻辑和交互式 HTML 小部件。用户与 AI 主机进行交互，这些主机使用 MCP 应用模式来渲染交互式 HTML 小部件。一个专用的 AWS Lambda 函数实现了业务逻辑，并使用 Amazon DynamoDB 进行持久化存储。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "545bc5bf0216d551",
      "translationZh": "下图展示了这些组件如何协同工作，从而为 AI 主机提供交互式小部件。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ca3687aa56ede379",
      "translationZh": "图 5：在 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 上的 MCP 应用架构",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2b7e13ef1b19618b",
      "translationZh": "当你向 AI 宿主注册一个 MCP 应用时，会发生以下情况：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3cd8cb5e5f561aed",
      "translationZh": "您提供包括 MCP 服务器 URL 在内的应用详情。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1e9e65d3e58a3e89",
      "translationZh": "AI 主机向 AgentCore Gateway 暴露的 MCP Server URL 发起 tools/list 和 resources/list MCP 调用。该 MCP 服务器提供诸如 list_unicorns、book_unicorn、view_bookings 和 return_unicorn 等工具，以及诸如 unicorn-list 和 booking-confirmation 等资源，这些资源为每个响应提供小部件 HTML。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "74619ef7c5974db0",
      "translationZh": "AWS WAF 通过其 IP 白名单和托管规则验证请求，随后 AgentCore Gateway 将其路由至 AgentCore 运行时。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "30b1f73d68e1744b",
      "translationZh": "AgentCore Gateway 使用其 AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM) 执行角色来调用 AgentCore 运行时。托管在其上的 MCP App 定义了 MCP 工具和 MCP 资源。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f13c12eeccbbedef",
      "translationZh": "MCP 应用接收请求并返回其中包含的工具或资源列表。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d097cc39f1f5556c",
      "translationZh": "AI 宿主可能会缓存该信息以备将来使用。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "581d65db658ea5e6",
      "translationZh": "以下是当用户尝试从 AI 宿主访问独角兽租赁服务时会发生的情况。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c33a2502a6c37487",
      "translationZh": "第一阶段 — 工具调用",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d62f2614ba64c497",
      "translationZh": "MCP App 接收请求，并将业务操作委托给 Unicorn Rental Service AWS Lambda。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cae5b30b74736e14",
      "translationZh": "AWS Lambda 对 DynamoDB 执行业务逻辑并返回结果。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b90a90715403d79e",
      "translationZh": "MCP App 将响应封装在 MCP 格式中并将其返回给 AI host。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "131eb87a5b4e4271",
      "translationZh": "第 2 阶段 — 组件渲染",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ed2c967af0932693",
      "translationZh": "如果工具有关联的资源 URI（例如 ui://widget/unicorn-list），则由 AI host 发起此阶段。没有关联组件的工具（例如 view_bookings 和 return_unicorn）仅返回纯文本内容并完全跳过此阶段。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9656faa061facef7",
      "translationZh": "host 发送针对该 URI 的 MCP resources/read 请求。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4b6ce2fd9ca65723",
      "translationZh": "请求通过 AgentCore Gateway 到达 MCP App。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e837a122ec43b929",
      "translationZh": "MCP App 解析资源 URI 并返回组件的自包含 HTML。AI host 可能会缓存此数据以获得更好的性能。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d50c3fd7d7ec2c91",
      "translationZh": "在 AgentCore 运行时上的 MCP 应用",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f32fabd6ccdc3b9c",
      "translationZh": "该解决方案将 MCP 应用部署在 AgentCore 运行时上。构建过程将 MCP 应用代码打包成一个 zip 文件。部署步骤将其上传到 Amazon S3 存储桶，并创建一个引用该文件的 AgentCore 运行时资源。运行时配置指定了 NODE_22 环境、入口点以及 MCP 协议模式。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ff7a5fc24927a2f1",
      "translationZh": "AgentCore 运行时为部署和运行 MCP 应用提供了一个安全、无服务器且专为特定用途设计的托管环境。它会根据传入的请求量自动进行扩展。MCP 协议配置会告知 AgentCore 这是一个 MCP 服务器，从而激活特定于协议的优化。基于资源的策略限制了哪些主体可以调用该运行时。在此解决方案中，该策略仅允许 AgentCore Gateway 执行角色，并拒绝其他主体。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f49c335dce6e31f6",
      "translationZh": "通过 AgentCore Gateway 暴露 MCP 服务器",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d7e315ef261e265a",
      "translationZh": "AgentCore 运行时支持用于调用的 IAM (SigV4) 和 OAuth 身份验证。此解决方案在运行时前面放置了一个 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Gateway，以便外部 AI 主机可以通过单个托管端点访问 MCP 服务器。网关接受无身份验证的传入请求，并使用其自身的 IAM 执行角色通过 SigV4 调用运行时，因此调用者无需自行处理 AWS 凭证。AWS WAF 通过 IP 白名单、托管威胁检测规则和速率限制来保护 AgentCore Gateway 端点。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ecd77dba3f3c1293",
      "translationZh": "一个 AWS Lambda 函数实现了独角兽租赁的业务逻辑。它处理针对 Amazon DynamoDB 的库存查询和预订操作。它对 MCP 一无所知。在实际应用中，这可以是您运行在 Amazon Elastic Container Service (Amazon ECS)、Amazon Elastic Kubernetes Service (Amazon EKS) 或其他计算服务上的现有服务。关键点在于，MCP 服务器充当一个薄协议适配器。您的核心业务逻辑保留在原处，您通过 HTTP 调用或 SDK 客户端等标准调用模式将其连接到 MCP 层。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "835b85fa1200d722",
      "translationZh": "部署演练",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "97a67c43e28f98ad",
      "translationZh": "以下章节将引导您完成如何部署该解决方案。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8b66c49aaf69a5b0",
      "translationZh": "在开始之前，请确认您已具备以下条件：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fccf7a292f9ef152",
      "translationZh": "一个拥有部署 AgentCore runtime 所需适当权限的 AWS 账户。有关所需的 IAM 权限，请参阅 IAM Permissions for AgentCore runtime .",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0ed1dbb7d5f623d4",
      "translationZh": "已安装并配置好 AWS Command Line Interface (AWS CLI) V2.0 或更高版本 ( aws configure )。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8ec4fc3fcfac3045",
      "translationZh": "已全局安装 AWS Cloud Development Kit (AWS CDK) CLI。有关说明，请参阅 Getting started with the AWS CDK .",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4093ba104c47b1d4",
      "translationZh": "部署过程使用单个 deploy.sh 脚本，用于编排构建和 CDK stack 部署。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1d0c9fde6e1abfa0",
      "translationZh": "步骤 1：下载解决方案代码：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "429fc8451bfc566e",
      "translationZh": "步骤 2：在您的 AWS 账户上部署所需资源。运行部署脚本以部署 CDK stacks：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
